msgid "Trader"
msgstr "Händler"

msgid "Traders Society"
msgstr "Händlergesellschaft"

msgid "Space Traders Society"
msgstr "Raumhandelsgesellschaft"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Space Traders Society is an organization that spans over all the "
"different guilds, and serves to protect their interests against the Empire, "
"Great Houses, and Soromid. Some of the prominent members include Astra "
"Vigilis, Mining Vrata, and the Imperial Red Star."
msgstr ""
"Die Weltraumhändlergesellschaft ist eine Organisation, die sich über alle "
"Gilden erstreckt und deren Interessen gegenüber dem Imperium, den Großen "
"Häusern und Soromid vertritt. Zu den prominenten Mitgliedern gehören Astra "
"Vigilis, Mining Vrata und der Imperial Red Star."

msgid "Wild Ones Pirate Clan"
msgstr "„Die Wilden“-Piratenklan"

msgid ""
"The Wild Ones Pirate Clan is a violent and loosely organized band of pirates "
"that control the Haven sector between Empire and Soromid territories."
msgstr ""
"Der Piratenklan „Die Wilden“ ist eine gewalttätige und lose organisierte "
"Piratenbande, die den Havensektor zwischen den Territorien des Imperiums und "
"der Soromiden kontrolliert."

msgid "Yetmer"
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid "House Yetmer"
msgstr "Haus Dvaered"

msgid ""
"While still officially part of House Yetmer-O'rez, to all practical effects, "
"House Yetmer is an independent minor house, engaged in a long war with House "
"O'rez."
msgstr ""

