#. Get rid of spawns
#. Spawn pirates
#, fuzzy
msgid "\"You ain't payin' yer wait outta this one!\""
msgstr "„Sie können sich hier nicht einfach freikaufen.“"

msgid "\"Do I look like a fuel station?\""
msgstr ""

#. On the way to the Spob from the south
