"\"Children say that people are hanged sometimes for speaking the truth.\""
msgstr ""
"„Kinder sagen, dass Menschen für das Aussprechen der Wahrheit manchmal "
"gehängt werden.“"

msgid "I am not afraid… I was born to do this."
