"\"Ummm, I hate to be that ship AI again, but I'm detecting an anomaly in the "
"cargo holds again…\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Hoping it's not a new pair of orphans, you head to the cargo holds to "
"investigate."
msgstr ""

