msgid "You diverged!"
msgstr "Du hast dich entfernt!"

msgid ""
"You have jumped to the wrong system! You are no longer part of the mission "
"to escort the diplomat."
msgstr ""
"Du bist in das falsche System gesprungen! Du bist nicht mehr Teil der "
"Mission, den Diplomaten zu eskortieren."

