#~ "start chatting.\n"
#~ "    Eventually, the topic of Chelsea's gender comes up. Chelsea explains "
#~ "that they are nonbinary and prefer they/them pronouns similarly to when "
#~ "they explained it to you. Their mother says that she is proud of them and "
#~ "hugs them."
